          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.84,
          "end": 159.13,
          "en": "Now, how can we achieve this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.13,
          "end": 162.71,
          "en": "Well, as so often you will have various options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.71,
          "end": 164.93,
          "en": "We could use the useNavigation hook",
