        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.2,
          "end": 191.02,
          "en": "And then just return an object here wrapped in parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.02,
          "end": 193.53,
          "en": "to make sure the syntax is not confused",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.53,
          "end": 195.55,
          "en": "with the function body.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.55,
          "end": 197.87,
          "en": "Instead, this is an object returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.87,
          "end": 201.053,
          "en": "in this form of the overall arrow function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.15,
          "end": 204.23,
          "en": "Now, if we use this function form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.23,
          "end": 207.05,
          "en": "we return the configuration object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.05,
          "end": 208.95,
          "en": "but we also get a couple of parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 208.95,
          "end": 213.49,
          "en": "passed into this function automatically by React Navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.49,
          "end": 215.98,
          "en": "and we can use object destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.98,
          "end": 219.43,
          "en": "to get hold of the different properties of that object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.43,
          "end": 222.79,
          "en": "that is passed in into this function by React Navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.79,
          "end": 226.03,
          "en": "and for example, we get the navigation object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.03,
          "end": 229.69,
          "en": "So this function here, which we pass to screen options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.69,
          "end": 232.43,
          "en": "will be executed by React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.43,
          "end": 236.35,
          "en": "It expects to get back the configuration object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.35,
          "end": 239.71,
          "en": "but it will give us an object as a parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.71,
          "end": 242.27,
          "en": "and that object which we receive automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.27,
