          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 264.76,
          "end": 269.363,
          "en": "and navigate to Manage Expense there as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.26,
          "end": 272.203,
          "en": "And that's one way of making sure",
